## Layers
Outermost to innermost. Source: docs/PROJECT.md "Arsitektur > Layered".
| Layer | Path | May import |
|---|---|---|
| App shell | src/app | screens, components, hooks, context, lib, services |
| Presentation | src/screens, src/components, src/hooks, src/context | application, domain, lib, services/api types, di (`make`) |
| Composition root | src/di | application, domain, infrastructure |
| Application | src/application | domain, lib, services, di |
| Feature logic | src/lib/<feature> | lib, services, di, domain |
| Infrastructure | src/infrastructure | domain, lib |
| Remote | src/services/api, src/services/upload | lib, di |
| Domain | src/domain | nothing outside src/domain |
| Native | macos/, windows/, cpp/ | n/a (C++/ObjC; JS reaches it through src/lib/storage bridge) |

Analysis ownership: production culling runs in C++ (cpp/analysis, cpp/face-detection). JS recomputes only as a fallback when native does not send the result. Source: docs/PROJECT.md "Ownership analisis".
Data-access seam: hooks in src/hooks and providers in src/context (TanStack Query for remote reads, culledAlbum store for local). Screens and components call hooks, not APIService.
Features: auth, album (site albums), culledAlbum (local culling: import, analysis, review, upload), plan (usage, top-up), look, export.

