## Import convention
- Cross-folder: path aliases from tsconfig.json and babel.config.js (`@/`, `@lib/`, `@services/`, `@context/`, `@components/`, `@hooks/`, `@screens/`, `@domain/`, `@infrastructure/`, `@application/`, `@di/`). Keep both files in sync when adding one.
- Same folder or child folder: relative `./`.
- Barrels exist for src/components/ui, src/domain, src/application, src/infrastructure, src/di, src/services/api. Import through them where they exist.
- `import type` for type-only imports.
- Formatting: prettier (singleQuote, trailingComma all, arrowParens avoid). No import-order lint rule.

## State ownership
| State | Owner | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Server data (user, site albums) | TanStack Query | query key factories next to the hook, e.g. `siteAlbumListQueryKey` in src/hooks/useSiteAlbumList.ts |
| Auth session | src/context/auth.tsx (Zustand+Immer store in context) | token in AsyncStorage via src/lib/auth |
| Local culled albums and photos (hot) | culledAlbumStore, src/lib/culledAlbum/store.ts | Zustand+Immer via `createStateStore` in src/lib/react/state.ts |
| Persisted culled data (cold) | SQLite via src/infrastructure | debounced persist from store; recovery on restart. Store owns, SQLite is the durable copy |
| Grid render snapshot | src/lib/culledAlbum/photoRenderStore.ts | throttled ~500 ms derivation of the store; grid subscribes here, not to every Immer write |
| Upload queue | src/lib/culledAlbum/uploadQueueStore.ts | |
| Errors / toasts | src/context/error.tsx | |
Source: docs/PROJECT.md "Dual state".

## Boundary translation points
- Wire types: src/services/api/generated-schema.d.ts (generated by `npm run generate-schema`, never hand-edit) wrapped by `APIResponse` / `APIRequest` namespaces in src/services/api/types.ts.
- Errors: `APIException` in src/services/api/exception.ts; app errors via src/lib/observability (`AppError`, `reportError`).
- Wire to app model: mappers such as src/application/plan/mapUserPlan.ts and src/lib/culledAlbum/photoMapper.ts.
- Native analysis results enter JS through src/lib/culledAlbum/analysisQueue.ts (chunked ingest).

## Stack wiring
- New Architecture (Fabric) disabled on macOS. react-native-screens excluded from macOS autolinking; JS stack navigator only. Source: README.md.
- DI: tsyringe + reflect-metadata through the src/di/tsyringe.ts facade. Repositories and use cases registered by hand in src/di/container.ts with tokens in src/di/tokens.ts. HTTP services use `@Injectable()` and `make()`.
- Stores: always create through src/lib/react/state.ts (`createStateStore` with Immer, `createVanillaStateStore` without).
- Platform split: Metro resolves `.macos` / `.windows` suffixes; Windows-only shims live in src/shims.
- Env: babel inlines only the vars listed in babel.config.js; channel from `GUMP_ENV` (local / staging / prod).
- Observability: PostHog via src/lib/observability.

## Project-specific hard rules
- Do not move culling work from C++ into JS; JS paths are fallbacks only. Source: docs/PROJECT.md.
- Grid and card components subscribe to photoRenderStore, never to culledAlbumStore directly. Source: docs/PROJECT.md "Dual state".
- Every new native dependency needs a macOS podspec and a Windows story (module or shim). Source: README.md "Dependency macOS Support".
- App versions are per platform: VERSION.macos, VERSION.windows. Source: README.md.

## Test layout
- Jest, `testMatch: **/__tests__/**/*.test.[jt]s?(x)`; all tests in root __tests__/.
- Helpers: __tests__/helpers (fixtures.ts, inMemoryRepos.ts, render.tsx); golden data in __tests__/fixtures; svg mock in __tests__/mocks.
- Repositories are faked with in-memory implementations, not SQLite.
- tests/ (gitignored) holds the native face/culling harness, not Jest.

